Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:56:42 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(motion): trochoidal slot maps measure()'s stock error
 to a named refusal

#783 made quality::measure return Result<PathQuality, StockError>; the
trochoidal slot (#563/#778) still read its fields directly, so main
stopped compiling once both merged. Both call sites now go through one
gauge closure that maps the error into the generator's named GenError,
with the wording the stock() closure already uses.

Fixes #844

