Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(motion): the trochoidal slot seeds its path under the
 approach law

The #697 approach law (every mill generator seeding X0 Y0 on the clearance
plane uses PathBuilder::approached) landed beside the trochoid, whose
finish() still used PathBuilder::new. Its first move is already a rapid, so
the path is unchanged; origin_approach's sweep is green again.

